I cannot go to Infopark by bus today.
I call the manager at the office on the phone.
"Hello sir, it is Maya," I say.
"Good morning Maya, what is the matter?" he asks.
"I cannot come to the office today," I say.
"I have a fever, and also a bad headache."
"Is that so?"
"You must certainly see a doctor," he says.
"Yes sir, my throat hurts too," I reply.
"I am going to see the doctor today itself."
"Okay Maya, you must rest well," the manager says.
"You should tell Prakash about this too," he adds.
"Okay sir, I will send a message to Prakash," I say.
After speaking, I hang up the phone.
Now I must call the clinic.
